{
  "version": 2,
  "notes": [
    "trustedSites: a page or download is trusted only on an exact host of an entry; hosts are the host of the entry's page, its www or bare twin, and the download host recorded for the project by the 2026-11-10 check (cdimage.debian.org is also the page of spec 8.9).",
    "trustedSites.exclude: hosts of the same site that publish other people's content or point to third-party mirrors. A page on a trusted host is not credited with a .torrent from one of them. A leading or inner * stands for one label.",
    "Not listed, because the project's own download page shows no torrent (checked 2026-11-10): CentOS (centos.org), openSUSE (opensuse.org), Tails (tails.net), FreeBSD (freebsd.org), Blender (blender.org) and the Wikimedia dumps (dumps.wikimedia.org).",
    "Piracy words: strong words count for a program, an archive, a disk image or a file without an extension, in its own name or in a folder above it, the torrent's name included. Weak words count only in the name of a program or a weakNameArchive. In a source release (sourceRelease), scripts, .jar files, files without an extension and source files are not counted. Media, documents, source files and other files are never counted by themselves.",
    "Renamed files: the helper marks a file renamed when libtorrent changed its name (it drops direction and zero-width characters, and replaces control characters); renamedFileReason is the reason it counts for.",
    "Hidden characters: every Default_Ignorable_Code_Point plus hiddenCharacters.extra, except joiners inside a word and the sequences in hiddenCharacters.allowed."
  ],
